[{"id":"shahida-41-20-4","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočit će","en":"will testify"},{"bs":"zar su prisustvovali?","en":"did they witness?"},{"bs":"i neka prisustvuje","en":"and let him witness"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"}],"ref":"41:20","answerWord":"شَهِدَ","answerSound":"audio/49e98d5fca9403165db9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Till, when they reach it, their ears and their eyes and their skins testify against them as to what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","مَا","جَآءُوهَا","شَهِدَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","سَمْعُهُمْ","وَأَبْصَٰرُهُمْ","وَجُلُودُهُم","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-4-166-2","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"},{"bs":"svjedočili smo","en":"we witnessed"},{"bs":"da prisustvuju","en":"so that they may witness"},{"bs":"pa svjedočite!","en":"so (you all) witness!"}],"ref":"4:166","answerWord":"يَشْهَدُ","answerSound":"audio/1e19c460e667b4782d12.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Allah (Himself) testifieth concerning that which He hath revealeth unto thee; in His knowledge hath He revealed it; and the angels also testify. And Allah is sufficient Witness.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["لَّٰكِنِ","ٱللَّهُ","يَشْهَدُ","بِمَآ","أَنزَلَ","إِلَيْكَ","أَنزَلَهُۥ","بِعِلْمِهِۦ","وَٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","يَشْهَدُونَ","وَكَفَىٰ","بِٱللَّهِ","شَهِيدًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-21-61-7","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedoče","en":"they witness"},{"bs":"svjedočite","en":"you witness"},{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"}],"ref":"21:61","answerWord":"يَشْهَدُونَ","answerSound":"audio/bc73ae90896a709e76b3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Then bring him (hither) before the people's eyes that they may testify.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","فَأْتُوا۟","بِهِۦ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَعْيُنِ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَشْهَدُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-3-70-7","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočite","en":"you witness"},{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"},{"bs":"svjedočili smo","en":"we witnessed"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"}],"ref":"3:70","answerWord":"تَشْهَدُونَ","answerSound":"audio/486cbf918246294242e5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O People of the Scripture! Why disbelieve ye in the revelations of Allah, when ye (yourselves) bear witness (to their truth)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَهْلَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لِمَ","تَكْفُرُونَ","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَشْهَدُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-3-52-17","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"},{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"i svjedočite!","en":"and (you all) witness!"}],"ref":"3:52","answerWord":"وَٱشْهَدْ","answerSound":"audio/e3a5e57314c32ef11429.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But when Jesus became conscious of their disbelief, he cried: Who will be my helpers in the cause of Allah? The disciples said: We will be Allah's helpers. We believe in Allah, and bear thou witness that we have surrendered (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["فَلَمَّآ","أَحَسَّ","عِيسَىٰ","مِنْهُمُ","ٱلْكُفْرَ","قَالَ","مَنْ","أَنصَارِىٓ","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","قَالَ","ٱلْحَوَارِيُّونَ","نَحْنُ","أَنصَارُ","ٱللَّهِ","ءَامَنَّا","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱشْهَدْ","بِأَنَّا","مُسْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-4-15-10","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočili su","en":"they witnessed"},{"bs":"zaista svjedočite","en":"surely you (all) witness"},{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"}],"ref":"4:15","answerWord":"شَهِدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d32294f0c051b1d8fa78.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for those of your women who are guilty of lewdness, call to witness four of you against them. And if they testify (to the truth of the allegation) then confine them to the houses until death take them or (until) Allah appoint for them a way (through new legislation).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["وَٱلَّٰتِى","يَأْتِينَ","ٱلْفَٰحِشَةَ","مِن","نِّسَآئِكُمْ","فَٱسْتَشْهِدُوا۟","عَلَيْهِنَّ","أَرْبَعَةً","مِّنكُمْ","فَإِن","شَهِدُوا۟","فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","فِى","ٱلْبُيُوتِ","حَتَّىٰ","يَتَوَفَّىٰهُنَّ","ٱلْمَوْتُ","أَوْ","يَجْعَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","لَهُنَّ","سَبِيلًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-6-130-15","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočili smo","en":"we witnessed"},{"bs":"svjedočili ste","en":"you (all) witnessed"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"},{"bs":"pa svjedočite!","en":"so (you all) witness!"}],"ref":"6:130","answerWord":"شَهِدْنَا","answerSound":"audio/7c73f450b4d36253f41f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye assembly of the jinn and humankind! Came there not unto you messengers of your own who recounted unto you My tokens and warned you of the meeting of this your Day? They will say: We testify against ourselves. And the life of the world beguiled them. And they testify against themselves that they were disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["يَٰمَعْشَرَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","وَٱلْإِنسِ","أَلَمْ","يَأْتِكُمْ","رُسُلٌ","مِّنكُمْ","يَقُصُّونَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِى","وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ","لِقَآءَ","يَوْمِكُمْ","هَٰذَا","قَالُوا۟","شَهِدْنَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِنَا","وَغَرَّتْهُمُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَشَهِدُوا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","أَنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","كَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-6-130-21","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i svjedočili su","en":"and they witnessed"},{"bs":"svjedočit će","en":"will testify"},{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"},{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"}],"ref":"6:130","answerWord":"وَشَهِدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/0e49faed9c8897544c79.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye assembly of the jinn and humankind! Came there not unto you messengers of your own who recounted unto you My tokens and warned you of the meeting of this your Day? They will say: We testify against ourselves. And the life of the world beguiled them. And they testify against themselves that they were disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["يَٰمَعْشَرَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","وَٱلْإِنسِ","أَلَمْ","يَأْتِكُمْ","رُسُلٌ","مِّنكُمْ","يَقُصُّونَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِى","وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ","لِقَآءَ","يَوْمِكُمْ","هَٰذَا","قَالُوا۟","شَهِدْنَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِنَا","وَغَرَّتْهُمُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَشَهِدُوا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","أَنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","كَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-7-172-16","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočili smo","en":"we witnessed"},{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"},{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"}],"ref":"7:172","answerWord":"شَهِدْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/90cf5899dbae4940c93e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when thy Lord brought forth from the Children of Adam, from their reins, their seed, and made them testify of themselves, (saying): Am I not your Lord? They said: Yea, verily. We testify. (That was) lest ye should say at the Day of Resurrection: Lo! of this we were unaware;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذَ","رَبُّكَ","مِنۢ","بَنِىٓ","ءَادَمَ","مِن","ظُهُورِهِمْ","ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ","وَأَشْهَدَهُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","أَلَسْتُ","بِرَبِّكُمْ","قَالُوا۟","بَلَىٰ","شَهِدْنَآ","أَن","تَقُولُوا۟","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","عَنْ","هَٰذَا","غَٰفِلِينَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-12-26-5","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i svjedočio je","en":"and he/it witnessed"},{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"prisustvujete uz mene","en":"you (all) are present with me"},{"bs":"svjedočili su","en":"they witnessed"}],"ref":"12:26","answerWord":"وَشَهِدَ","answerSound":"audio/903ccb00efb3dbe3486b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Joseph) said: She it was who asked of me an evil act. And a witness of her own folk testified: If his shirt is torn from before, then she speaketh truth and he is of the liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["قَالَ","هِىَ","رَٰوَدَتْنِى","عَن","نَّفْسِى","وَشَهِدَ","شَاهِدٌ","مِّنْ","أَهْلِهَآ","إِن","كَانَ","قَمِيصُهُۥ","قُدَّ","مِن","قُبُلٍ","فَصَدَقَتْ","وَهُوَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-3-86-7","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i svjedočili su","en":"and they witnessed"},{"bs":"i neka prisustvuje","en":"and let him witness"},{"bs":"i svjedočite!","en":"and (you all) witness!"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"}],"ref":"3:86","answerWord":"وَشَهِدُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/4639c7154c3c1a662b4a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How shall Allah guide a people who disbelieved after their belief and (after) they bore witness that the messenger is true and after clear proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty) had come unto them. And Allah guideth not wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["كَيْفَ","يَهْدِى","ٱللَّهُ","قَوْمًا","كَفَرُوا۟","بَعْدَ","إِيمَٰنِهِمْ","وَشَهِدُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","حَقٌّ","وَجَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-11-54-11","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i svjedočite!","en":"and (you all) witness!"},{"bs":"svjedočite","en":"you witness"},{"bs":"i svjedočio je","en":"and he/it witnessed"},{"bs":"zar su prisustvovali?","en":"did they witness?"}],"ref":"11:54","answerWord":"وَٱشْهَدُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/2374f57b471c0bf5ed88.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We say naught save that one of our gods hath possessed thee in an evil way. He said: I call Allah to witness, and do ye (too) bear witness, that I am innocent of (all) that ye ascribe as partners (to Allah)","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["إِن","نَّقُولُ","إِلَّا","ٱعْتَرَىٰكَ","بَعْضُ","ءَالِهَتِنَا","بِسُوٓءٍ","قَالَ","إِنِّىٓ","أُشْهِدُ","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱشْهَدُوٓا۟","أَنِّى","بَرِىٓءٌ","مِّمَّا","تُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-22-28-0","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"da prisustvuju","en":"so that they may witness"},{"bs":"zaista svjedočite","en":"surely you (all) witness"},{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"}],"ref":"22:28","answerWord":"لِّيَشْهَدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/804d83ce79847ea081ca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That they may witness things that are of benefit to them, and mention the name of Allah on appointed days over the beast of cattle that He hath bestowed upon them. Then eat thereof and feed therewith the poor unfortunate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["لِّيَشْهَدُوا۟","مَنَٰفِعَ","لَهُمْ","وَيَذْكُرُوا۟","ٱسْمَ","ٱللَّهِ","فِىٓ","أَيَّامٍ","مَّعْلُومَٰتٍ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","رَزَقَهُم","مِّنۢ","بَهِيمَةِ","ٱلْأَنْعَٰمِ","فَكُلُوا۟","مِنْهَا","وَأَطْعِمُوا۟","ٱلْبَآئِسَ","ٱلْفَقِيرَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-24-2-21","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"i neka prisustvuje","en":"and let him witness"},{"bs":"svjedočili su","en":"they witnessed"},{"bs":"zaista svjedočite","en":"surely you (all) witness"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"}],"ref":"24:2","answerWord":"وَلْيَشْهَدْ","answerSound":"audio/865458b7a6439bfb450d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The adulterer and the adulteress, scourge ye each one of them (with) a hundred stripes. And let not pity for the twain withhold you from obedience to Allah, if ye believe in Allah and the Last Day. And let a party of believers witness their punishment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["ٱلزَّانِيَةُ","وَٱلزَّانِى","فَٱجْلِدُوا۟","كُلَّ","وَٰحِدٍ","مِّنْهُمَا","مِا۟ئَةَ","جَلْدَةٍ","وَلَا","تَأْخُذْكُم","بِهِمَا","رَأْفَةٌ","فِى","دِينِ","ٱللَّهِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَلْيَشْهَدْ","عَذَابَهُمَا","طَآئِفَةٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-27-32-11","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"prisustvujete uz mene","en":"you (all) are present with me"},{"bs":"svjedočili smo","en":"we witnessed"},{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"i svjedočili su","en":"and they witnessed"}],"ref":"27:32","answerWord":"تَشْهَدُونِ","answerSound":"audio/89ef59f46babfdeaf321.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"She said: O chieftains! Pronounce for me in my case. I decide no case till ye are present with me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["قَالَتْ","يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلْمَلَؤُا۟","أَفْتُونِى","فِىٓ","أَمْرِى","مَا","كُنتُ","قَاطِعَةً","أَمْرًا","حَتَّىٰ","تَشْهَدُونِ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-41-21-3","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočili ste","en":"you (all) witnessed"},{"bs":"i svjedočio je","en":"and he/it witnessed"},{"bs":"prisustvujete uz mene","en":"you (all) are present with me"},{"bs":"svjedočili su","en":"they witnessed"}],"ref":"41:21","answerWord":"شَهِدتُّمْ","answerSound":"audio/723070cb1d900dcc985f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say unto their skins: Why testify ye against us? They say: Allah hath given us speech Who giveth speech to all things, and Who created you at the first, and unto Whom ye are returned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","لِجُلُودِهِمْ","لِمَ","شَهِدتُّمْ","عَلَيْنَا","قَالُوٓا۟","أَنطَقَنَا","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنطَقَ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","وَهُوَ","خَلَقَكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَإِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-41-22-4","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedoči","en":"he/it witnesses"},{"bs":"i svjedoči!","en":"and witness!"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"},{"bs":"svjedoče","en":"they witness"}],"ref":"41:22","answerWord":"يَشْهَدَ","answerSound":"audio/a085069a9061896bee06.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye did not hide yourselves lest your ears and your eyes and your skins should testify against you, but ye deemed that Allah knew not much of what ye did.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَتِرُونَ","أَن","يَشْهَدَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","سَمْعُكُمْ","وَلَآ","أَبْصَٰرُكُمْ","وَلَا","جُلُودُكُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","ظَنَنتُمْ","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُ","كَثِيرًا","مِّمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-43-19-7","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"zar su prisustvovali?","en":"did they witness?"},{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"da prisustvuju","en":"so that they may witness"},{"bs":"prisustvujete uz mene","en":"you (all) are present with me"}],"ref":"43:19","answerWord":"أَشَهِدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/680130fd7519421ec1be.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they make the angels, who are the slaves of the Beneficent, females. Did they witness their creation? Their testimony will be recorded and they will be questioned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["وَجَعَلُوا۟","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","هُمْ","عِبَٰدُ","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ","إِنَٰثًا","أَشَهِدُوا۟","خَلْقَهُمْ","سَتُكْتَبُ","شَهَٰدَتُهُمْ","وَيُسْـَٔلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-63-1-4","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"svjedočimo","en":"we witness"},{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"},{"bs":"pa svjedočite!","en":"so (you all) witness!"},{"bs":"svjedočim","en":"I witness"}],"ref":"63:1","answerWord":"نَشْهَدُ","answerSound":"audio/85be9e8785a8286da101.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the hypocrites come unto thee (O Muhammad), they say: We bear witness that thou art indeed Allah's messenger. And Allah knoweth that thou art indeed His messenger, and Allah beareth witness that the hypocrites indeed are speaking falsely.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["إِذَا","جَآءَكَ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقُونَ","قَالُوا۟","نَشْهَدُ","إِنَّكَ","لَرَسُولُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","إِنَّكَ","لَرَسُولُهُۥ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَشْهَدُ","إِنَّ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"shahida-83-21-0","words":["verb:shahida"],"options":[{"bs":"prisustvuje mu","en":"he/it witnesses it"},{"bs":"i svjedočio je","en":"and he/it witnessed"},{"bs":"i svjedočili su","en":"and they witnessed"},{"bs":"svjedočite!","en":"(you all) witness!"}],"ref":"83:21","answerWord":"يَشْهَدُهُ","answerSound":"audio/d8c2d407c99eaec0dd79.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Attested by those who are brought near (unto their Lord).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"svjedočiti, prisustvovati","en":"to witness, to testify"},"passage":["يَشْهَدُهُ","ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"شَهِدَ"}},{"id":"taraka-2-180-7","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavio je","en":"he/it left"},{"bs":"ostavile su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"zar bivate ostavljeni?","en":"are you (all) left?"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"}],"ref":"2:180","answerWord":"تَرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/1a48a07adcdec6d833fa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is prescribed for you, when death approacheth one of you, if he leave wealth, that he bequeath unto parents and near relatives in kindness. (This is) a duty for all those who ward off (evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["كُتِبَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِذَا","حَضَرَ","أَحَدَكُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتُ","إِن","تَرَكَ","خَيْرًا","ٱلْوَصِيَّةُ","لِلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ","وَٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","حَقًّا","عَلَى","ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-37-78-0","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavili smo","en":"and We left"},{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"},{"bs":"ostavljamo","en":"we leave"}],"ref":"37:78","answerWord":"وَتَرَكْنَا","answerSound":"audio/252f6039e569fc38995a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And left for him among the later folk (the salutation):","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَتَرَكْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-44-25-1","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavili su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"ostavili ste ih","en":"you (all) left them"},{"bs":"i ostavili ste","en":"and you (all) left"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"}],"ref":"44:25","answerWord":"تَرَكُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/38a44a4150d832ad034d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How many were the gardens and the watersprings that they left behind,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["كَمْ","تَرَكُوا۟","مِن","جَنَّٰتٍ","وَعُيُونٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-12-37-16","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavio sam","en":"I left"},{"bs":"zar bivate ostavljeni?","en":"are you (all) left?"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"},{"bs":"ostavili ste","en":"you (all) left"}],"ref":"12:37","answerWord":"تَرَكْتُ","answerSound":"audio/370884f5c9aff7260100.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: The food which ye are given (daily) shall not come unto you but I shall tell you the interpretation ere it cometh unto you. This is of that which my Lord hath taught me. Lo! I have forsaken the religion of folk who believe not in Allah and are disbelievers in the Hereafter.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَا","يَأْتِيكُمَا","طَعَامٌ","تُرْزَقَانِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","نَبَّأْتُكُمَا","بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦ","قَبْلَ","أَن","يَأْتِيَكُمَا","ذَٰلِكُمَا","مِمَّا","عَلَّمَنِى","رَبِّىٓ","إِنِّى","تَرَكْتُ","مِلَّةَ","قَوْمٍ","لَّا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَهُم","بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","هُمْ","كَٰفِرُونَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-2-17-12","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavio ih je","en":"and he/it left them"},{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"},{"bs":"ostavili su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"}],"ref":"2:17","answerWord":"وَتَرَكَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ec1914bb20efa8a9eff9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Their likeness is as the likeness of one who kindleth fire, and when it sheddeth its light around him Allah taketh away their light and leaveth them in darkness, where they cannot see,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["مَثَلُهُمْ","كَمَثَلِ","ٱلَّذِى","ٱسْتَوْقَدَ","نَارًا","فَلَمَّآ","أَضَآءَتْ","مَا","حَوْلَهُۥ","ذَهَبَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِنُورِهِمْ","وَتَرَكَهُمْ","فِى","ظُلُمَٰتٍ","لَّا","يُبْصِرُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-6-94-7","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavili ste","en":"and you (all) left"},{"bs":"ostavili smo","en":"we left"},{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"},{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"}],"ref":"6:94","answerWord":"وَتَرَكْتُم","answerSound":"audio/7beb58c90405934823d9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Now have ye come unto Us solitary as We did create you at the first, and ye have left behind you all that We bestowed upon you, and We behold not with you those your intercessors, of whom ye claimed that they possessed a share in you. Now is the bond between you severed, and that which ye presumed hath failed you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","جِئْتُمُونَا","فُرَٰدَىٰ","كَمَا","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَتَرَكْتُم","مَّا","خَوَّلْنَٰكُمْ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِكُمْ","وَمَا","نَرَىٰ","مَعَكُمْ","شُفَعَآءَكُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","زَعَمْتُمْ","أَنَّهُمْ","فِيكُمْ","شُرَكَٰٓؤُا۟","لَقَد","تَّقَطَّعَ","بَيْنَكُمْ","وَضَلَّ","عَنكُم","مَّا","كُنتُمْ","تَزْعُمُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-9-16-3","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"bivate ostavljeni","en":"you (all) are left"},{"bs":"ostavile su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"ostavili ste ih","en":"you (all) left them"},{"bs":"ostavili smo","en":"we left"}],"ref":"9:16","answerWord":"تُتْرَكُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3f008fd41d511a266f22.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or deemed ye that ye would be left (in peace) when Allah yet knoweth not those of you who strive, choosing for familiar none save Allah and His messenger and the believers? Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["أَمْ","حَسِبْتُمْ","أَن","تُتْرَكُوا۟","وَلَمَّا","يَعْلَمِ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","جَٰهَدُوا۟","مِنكُمْ","وَلَمْ","يَتَّخِذُوا۟","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","رَسُولِهِۦ","وَلَا","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَلِيجَةً","وَٱللَّهُ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-11-87-5","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavljamo","en":"we leave"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"ostavili su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"ostavili ste ih","en":"you (all) left them"}],"ref":"11:87","answerWord":"نَّتْرُكَ","answerSound":"audio/07603b85453c3d2545d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: O Shu'eyb! Doth thy way of prayer command thee that we should forsake that which our fathers (used to) worship, or that we (should leave off) doing what we will with our own property. Lo! thou art the mild, the guide to right behaviour.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","يَٰشُعَيْبُ","أَصَلَوٰتُكَ","تَأْمُرُكَ","أَن","نَّتْرُكَ","مَا","يَعْبُدُ","ءَابَآؤُنَآ","أَوْ","أَن","نَّفْعَلَ","فِىٓ","أَمْوَٰلِنَا","مَا","نَشَٰٓؤُا۟","إِنَّكَ","لَأَنتَ","ٱلْحَلِيمُ","ٱلرَّشِيدُ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-26-146-0","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"zar bivate ostavljeni?","en":"are you (all) left?"},{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"},{"bs":"ostavile su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"ostavio sam","en":"I left"}],"ref":"26:146","answerWord":"أَتُتْرَكُونَ","answerSound":"audio/fb207669581db5c4c359.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Will ye be left secure in that which is here before us,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["أَتُتْرَكُونَ","فِى","مَا","هَٰهُنَآ","ءَامِنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-29-2-3","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju ostavljeni","en":"they are left"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"bivate ostavljeni","en":"you (all) are left"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"}],"ref":"29:2","answerWord":"يُتْرَكُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/e7b177fd05642f38b876.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Do men imagine that they will be left (at ease) because they say, We believe, and will not be tested with affliction?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["أَحَسِبَ","ٱلنَّاسُ","أَن","يُتْرَكُوٓا۟","أَن","يَقُولُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُفْتَنُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-29-35-1","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavili smo","en":"we left"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"},{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"},{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"}],"ref":"29:35","answerWord":"تَّرَكْنَا","answerSound":"audio/4153d540ea84ec89f349.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily of that We have left a clear sign for people who have sense.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَلَقَد","تَّرَكْنَا","مِنْهَآ","ءَايَةًۢ","بَيِّنَةً","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-44-24-0","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"pa ga je ostavio","en":"so he/it left it"},{"bs":"ostavili ste","en":"you (all) left"},{"bs":"i ostavio ih je","en":"and he/it left them"}],"ref":"44:24","answerWord":"وَٱتْرُكِ","answerSound":"audio/39ac73895bb6e5a74747.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And leave the sea behind at rest, for lo! they are a drowned host.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَٱتْرُكِ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","رَهْوًا","إِنَّهُمْ","جُندٌ","مُّغْرَقُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-54-15-1","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"i ostavio ih je","en":"and he/it left them"},{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"}],"ref":"54:15","answerWord":"تَّرَكْنَٰهَآ","answerSound":"audio/703c9444844be5de1860.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily We left it as a token; but is there any that remembereth?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَلَقَد","تَّرَكْنَٰهَآ","ءَايَةً","فَهَلْ","مِن","مُّدَّكِرٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-59-5-5","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavili ste ih","en":"you (all) left them"},{"bs":"ostavili ste","en":"you (all) left"},{"bs":"ostavili su","en":"they left"},{"bs":"i ostavio ih je","en":"and he/it left them"}],"ref":"59:5","answerWord":"تَرَكْتُمُوهَا","answerSound":"audio/a979c965938e650bb1d7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whatsoever palm-trees ye cut down or left standing on their roots, it was by Allah's leave, in order that He might confound the evil-livers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["مَا","قَطَعْتُم","مِّن","لِّينَةٍ","أَوْ","تَرَكْتُمُوهَا","قَآئِمَةً","عَلَىٰٓ","أُصُولِهَا","فَبِإِذْنِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلِيُخْزِىَ","ٱلْفَٰسِقِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-62-11-7","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavili su te","en":"and they left you"},{"bs":"i ostavili ste","en":"and you (all) left"},{"bs":"bivate ostavljeni","en":"you (all) are left"},{"bs":"ostavili smo ga","en":"we left it"}],"ref":"62:11","answerWord":"وَتَرَكُوكَ","answerSound":"audio/03c1e4f8dce239be16a1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But when they spy some merchandise or pastime they break away to it and leave thee standing. Say: That which Allah hath is better than pastime and than merchandise, and Allah is the Best of providers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","رَأَوْا۟","تِجَٰرَةً","أَوْ","لَهْوًا","ٱنفَضُّوٓا۟","إِلَيْهَا","وَتَرَكُوكَ","قَآئِمًا","قُلْ","مَا","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","خَيْرٌ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهْوِ","وَمِنَ","ٱلتِّجَٰرَةِ","وَٱللَّهُ","خَيْرُ","ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"taraka-75-36-3","words":["verb:taraka"],"options":[{"bs":"biva ostavljen","en":"he/it is left"},{"bs":"i ostavili ste","en":"and you (all) left"},{"bs":"i ostavili su te","en":"and they left you"},{"bs":"bivate ostavljeni","en":"you (all) are left"}],"ref":"75:36","answerWord":"يُتْرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/f529d840027c7f094c58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thinketh man that he is to be left aimless?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, napustiti","en":"to leave, to abandon"},"passage":["أَيَحْسَبُ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","أَن","يُتْرَكَ","سُدًى"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"تَرَكَ"}},{"id":"intasara-42-39-5","words":["verb:intasara"],"options":[{"bs":"brane se","en":"they defend themselves"},{"bs":"i odbranili su se","en":"and they defended themselves"},{"bs":"brani se","en":"defends himself"},{"bs":"pa pomozi","en":"so help (me)"}],"ref":"42:39","answerWord":"يَنتَصِرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/2affd172d27c5d387f9d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who, when great wrong is done to them, defend themselves,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobijediti, odbraniti se","en":"to win, to defend oneself"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَآ","أَصَابَهُمُ","ٱلْبَغْىُ","هُمْ","يَنتَصِرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"انتَصَرَ"}},{"id":"intasara-26-227-8","words":["verb:intasara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odbranili su se","en":"and they defended themselves"},{"bs":"pa pomozi","en":"so help (me)"},{"bs":"brani se","en":"defends himself"},{"bs":"brane se","en":"they defend themselves"}],"ref":"26:227","answerWord":"وَٱنتَصَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8b1e9caebfc0e8ff9703.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Save those who believe and do good works, and remember Allah much, and vindicate themselves after they have been wronged. Those who do wrong will come to know by what a (great) reverse they will be overturned!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobijediti, odbraniti se","en":"to win, to defend oneself"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","وَذَكَرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","كَثِيرًا","وَٱنتَصَرُوا۟","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","ظُلِمُوا۟","وَسَيَعْلَمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَىَّ","مُنقَلَبٍ","يَنقَلِبُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"انتَصَرَ"}},{"id":"intasara-42-41-1","words":["verb:intasara"],"options":[{"bs":"brani se","en":"defends himself"},{"bs":"brane se","en":"they defend themselves"},{"bs":"pa pomozi","en":"so help (me)"},{"bs":"i odbranili su se","en":"and they defended themselves"}],"ref":"42:41","answerWord":"ٱنتَصَرَ","answerSound":"audio/114d8e619052df5dfabe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso defendeth himself after he hath suffered wrong - for such, there is no way (of blame) against them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobijediti, odbraniti se","en":"to win, to defend oneself"},"passage":["وَلَمَنِ","ٱنتَصَرَ","بَعْدَ","ظُلْمِهِۦ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَا","عَلَيْهِم","مِّن","سَبِيلٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"انتَصَرَ"}},{"id":"intasara-54-10-4","words":["verb:intasara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa pomozi","en":"so help (me)"},{"bs":"brani se","en":"defends himself"},{"bs":"brane se","en":"they defend themselves"},{"bs":"i odbranili su se","en":"and they defended themselves"}],"ref":"54:10","answerWord":"فَٱنتَصِرْ","answerSound":"audio/6a3fa03b661825c58772.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So he cried unto his Lord, saying: I am vanquished, so give help.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobijediti, odbraniti se","en":"to win, to defend oneself"},"passage":["فَدَعَا","رَبَّهُۥٓ","أَنِّى","مَغْلُوبٌ","فَٱنتَصِرْ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"انتَصَرَ"}}]